Subject: [PATCH 0963/3799] soh: rename D_80899520 -> sThroneDebrisLifetimes

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: the throne counterpart of sPillarDebrisLifetimes, feeding the same life parameter in BgJyaIronobj_SpawnThoneParticles.
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Bg_Jya_Ironobj/z_bg_jya_ironobj.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 .../overlays/actors/ovl_Bg_Jya_Ironobj/z_bg_jya_ironobj.c    | 5 +++--
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Bg_Jya_Ironobj/z_bg_jya_ironobj.c b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Bg_Jya_Ironobj/z_bg_jya_ironobj.c
